<title>USA: Wyoming, Mich., $3.055 mln won by First of Mich.</title>
<headline>Wyoming, Mich., $3.055 mln won by First of Mich.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>First of Michigan Corp said it won $3.055 million of Wyoming, Mich., sewerage disposal system revenue bonds, Series 1997 with a net interest cost of 5.27 percent.</p>
</text>
